mmc-utils: mmc-utils (Configure MMC storage devices from userspace)
mmc-utils:
mmc-utils: mmc-utils is a command line tool for managing eMMC storage devices.
mmc-utils: It can print and parse extcsd and CID data, get or set write protect
mmc-utils: status, create general purpose partitions, enable the enhanced user
mmc-utils: area and write reliability, and set a 4KB sector size.
mmc-utils:
mmc-utils: It also handles boot partitions and bus conditions, BKOPS, cache
mmc-utils: control, permanent H/W reset, CMD13 status, sanitize, and RPMB key,
mmc-utils: counter, read and write operations.
